{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kissed By A Star</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kissed By A Star is a turn-based RPG with heavy novel elements. Traverse through several rapidly-paced chapters featuring a cycling cast of point of views. From fighting monstrosities in a smog filled forest, to lazing about on a passenger train. You never know where the journey will take you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Fall</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world that was seemingly thriving. The Sun's light grew dim. Civilization as they knew it fell into a new era. A time where evil reemerges, evil long forgotten.\u00a0 Not only must people fight this forgotten evil. They must learn to coexist with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All roads lead to the City of a New Future: Brigitte Bay. Where a new normality is established, where one can live their life in peace, or a place to gather for the fight to regain what they lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, reaching the city is easier said than done...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Full length turn-based RPG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A huge cast of characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A detailed modern fantasy world, full of mystery and ominous occurrences</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Light RPG elements that make it easy to jump into a chapter at anytime and not feel overwhelmed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-original FM Synth inspired soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-charming cartoon styled pixel art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-elaborate Glossary\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-LGBTQ+ friendly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning: There are depictions of violence, such as pixel art blood in a cartoon style.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3727750?t=1746799929","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3727750?t=1746799929","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727750/b9ee09cf5a9d45615a14430caf23a71de65974b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746799929","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727750/b9ee09cf5a9d45615a14430caf23a71de65974b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746799929","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kissed By A Star</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kissed By A Star is a turn-based RPG with heavy novel elements. Traverse through several rapidly-paced chapters featuring a cycling cast of point of views. From fighting monstrosities in a smog filled forest, to lazing about on a passenger train. You never know where the journey will take you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Fall</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world that was seemingly thriving. The Sun's light grew dim. Civilization as they knew it fell into a new era. A time where evil reemerges, evil long forgotten.\u00a0 Not only must people fight this forgotten evil. They must learn to coexist with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All roads lead to the City of a New Future: Brigitte Bay. Where a new normality is established, where one can live their life in peace, or a place to gather for the fight to regain what they lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, reaching the city is easier said than done...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Full length turn-based RPG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A huge cast of characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A detailed modern fantasy world, full of mystery and ominous occurrences</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Light RPG elements that make it easy to jump into a chapter at anytime and not feel overwhelmed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-original FM Synth inspired soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-charming cartoon styled pixel art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-elaborate Glossary\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-LGBTQ+ friendly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning: There are depictions of violence, such as pixel art blood in a cartoon style.</p>","developers":["zDS"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727750/62b1e1437aef02a83bf138a0e554ca60ec619835/header.jpg?t=1746799929","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3727750/2071942041/7031c6f29bd4a179377fb026bdb611c49536575d/1750394950/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746799928","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3727750/2071942041/7031c6f29bd4a179377fb026bdb611c49536575d/1750394950/dash_h264.mpd?t=1746799928","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3727750/2071942041/7031c6f29bd4a179377fb026bdb611c49536575d/1750394950/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1746799928","id":257136406,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136406/movie480.mp4?t=1746799928","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136406/movie_max.mp4?t=